{
  "title": "Ground Turkey Egg Roll in a Bowl",
  "description": "This quick ground turkey egg roll in a bowl delivers 31g of protein in just 22 minutes. Shredded cabbage and seasoned ground turkey toss in a savory soy-ginger glaze for a simple one-skillet dinner. Save it for your next meal prep.",
  "cuisine": "Asian-Inspired",
